OL,3,GNEWSA'Bonkers' Shakespeare Institute
OL,4,Amove must end, says actor
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Samuel West has welcomed the
OL,7,FUniversity of Birmingham's decision to
OL,8,Fpause plans to relocate the Shakespeare
OL,9,FInstitute from Stratford-upon-Avon, but
OL,10,Fsaid it was now time to "remove the
OL,11,Fidea" altogether.
OL,13,FWest, who is spearheading a petition
OL,14,Fagainst the move with more than 16,000
OL,15,Fsignatures, described the institute as
OL,16,F"a jewel in the crown" and said there
OL,17,Fwas "no particular reason for students
OL,18,Fof Shakespeare to go to Edgbaston in
OL,19,FBirmingham".
